---

<BaseLayout
    title={pageTitle}
    description={pageDescription}
>
    <!-- Structured JSON-LD Schema Graph -->
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(pageSchema)} />

    <main class="dcrs-service-page">

        <!-- 1. HERO / OPENING ------------------------------------------------>
        <header class="dcrs-hero-banner">
            <div class="dcrs-hero-banner__scrim"></div>
            <div class="dcrs-container dcrs-hero-banner__inner">
                <nav class="dcrs-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
                    <ol>
                        <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/#service">Services</a></li>
                        <li aria-current="page">Car AC Repair Dubai</li>
                    </ol>
                </nav>
                <span class="dcrs-badge">Al Satwa, Dubai · AC Repair &amp; Gas Refill · All Makes &amp; Models</span>
                <h1 class="dcrs-hero-banner__title">
                    Car AC Repair Dubai - Gas Refill, Compressor &amp; Leak Fix
                </h1>
                <p class="dcrs-hero-banner__lead">
                    Dubai's prolonged summer heat and extreme under-hood temperatures place severe demands on automotive air conditioning systems, leading to rapid refrigerant loss, compressor clutch wear, and reduced cabin cooling. Our car AC repair in Dubai provides systematic electronic leak detection, factory-calibrated R134a and R1234yf gas refills, compressor overhauls, and evaporator coil servicing. From our dedicated workshop at 222 Al Satwa Road, our experienced mechanics restore factory cooling performance with fast and affordable pricing.
                </p>
                <div class="dcrs-hero-banner__actions">
                    <a href={phoneHref} class="dcrs-btn dcrs-btn--solid">
                        <Fragment set:html={icons.phone} /> Call {phoneDisplay}
                    </a>
                    <a href={waHref} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="dcrs-btn dcrs-btn--wa">
                        <Fragment set:html={icons.chat} /> WhatsApp Us
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </header>

        <!-- 2. SERVICE OVERVIEW ---------------------------------------------->
        <section class="dcrs-section dcrs-section--paper" id="service-overview">
            <div class="dcrs-container">
                <div class="dcrs-grid-2col dcrs-grid-2col--align-center">
                    
                    <div class="dcrs-intro-content">
                        <div class="dcrs-kicker">Service Overview</div>
                        <h2 class="dcrs-heading__title">
                            Car AC Repair Dubai - Fast Diagnostics &amp; Complete Cooling Fixes
                        </h2>
                        <p class="dcrs-lead-text">
                            Operating a vehicle in Dubai without an efficient air conditioning system is intolerable during summer months when ambient temperatures consistently surpass 45°C. Under-hood temperatures often reach 70°C, causing refrigerant gas pressures to surge and placing continuous mechanical load on compressor clutch assemblies, condenser cooling fans, and rubber connection hoses. Dubai Car Repair Service delivers specialized automotive climate control diagnostics, precision refrigerant recharging, and component-level repairs to keep your vehicle cool and comfortable year-round.
                        </p>
                        <p class="dcrs-body-text">
                            A common mistake in vehicle AC maintenance is repeatedly topping up refrigerant gas without identifying the underlying leak path. Adding refrigerant to a leaking circuit provides only temporary relief while allowing moisture and atmospheric air to enter, which rapidly degrades polyalkylene glycol (PAG) compressor oil and leads to catastrophic compressor seizure. Our technicians use digital manifold pressure gauges, ultrasonic detectors, and UV fluorescent dye testing under nitrogen pressure to pinpoint micro-leaks in evaporator cores, condenser tubes, expansion valves, and O-ring seals. For complex cooling concerns linked to engine overheating, our garage also provides complete <a href="/car-engine-service-dubai" class="dcrs-inline-link">car engine cooling repair</a> and preventative <a href="/car-maintenance-dubai" class="dcrs-inline-link">annual vehicle maintenance</a>.
                        </p>
                        <p class="dcrs-body-text">
                            Whether you need a quick cabin filter replacement, a routine pressure test, or a comprehensive compressor rebuild, our mechanics service Japanese, European, and American models with equal proficiency. For mobile refrigerant top-ups or battery-related cooling fan faults at your doorstep, our <a href="/mobile-car-repair-dubai" class="dcrs-inline-link">mobile car mechanic service</a> is available throughout Dubai. Drivers are welcome to visit our workshop at 222 Al Satwa Road or speak with our service advisors through our <a href="/contact" class="dcrs-inline-link">customer contact team</a> for honest, transparent advice.
                        </p>

                        <div class="dcrs-action-row">
                            <a href={phoneHref} class="dcrs-btn dcrs-btn--solid">
                                <Fragment set:html={icons.phone} /> Call Workshop
                            </a>
                            <a href="/contact" class="dcrs-btn dcrs-btn--outline-ink">
                                Book Inspection <Fragment set:html={icons.arrowRight} />
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="dcrs-intro-media">
                        <div class="dcrs-intro-media__frame">
                            <img
                                src={service6Image.src}
                                alt="Technician testing refrigerant pressure during car AC repair in Dubai at Al Satwa garage"
                                loading="eager"
                                width="600"
                                height="400"
                            />
                            <div class="dcrs-plate dcrs-price-badge" aria-hidden="true">
                                <div class="dcrs-plate__tab">AED</div>
                                <div class="dcrs-plate__body">
                                    <span class="dcrs-plate__row dcrs-plate__row--big">100+</span>
                                    <span class="dcrs-plate__row">GAS REFILL FROM</span>
                                    <span class="dcrs-plate__row">AL SATWA WORKSHOP</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 3. PRICING AND COST FACTORS -------------------------------------->
        <section class="dcrs-section dcrs-section--tint" id="pricing">
            <div class="dcrs-container">
                <div class="dcrs-heading dcrs-heading--center">
                    <div class="dcrs-kicker">Fast and Affordable Pricing</div>
                    <h2 class="dcrs-heading__title">Car AC Repair &amp; Gas Refill Pricing Guide</h2>
                    <p class="dcrs-heading__sub">
                        Clear, transparent estimates before work begins. Prices vary by refrigerant specification (R134a vs. R1234yf), vehicle make, and system condition.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="dcrs-table-wrapper">
                    <table class="dcrs-pricing-table">
                        <thead>
                            <tr>
                                <th>Service / Repair</th>
                                <th>Starting Price (AED)</th>
                                <th>Turnaround Time</th>
                                <th>Warranty</th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody>
